      "text": [
        "Booked, not squeezed in",
        "Every appointment gets its own block of time. Your slot is yours — I don't overbook to fit extra clients around you.",
        "One barber, always",
        "You'll never be handed to someone else. The person who takes your booking is the person who cuts your hair.",
        "A calm, private space",
        "A small studio, not a shop floor — no waiting room, no other clients watching. Just you, the chair, and the work."
      ]
